      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm sorry to hear you're in pain. Kidney stones can indeed cause such symptoms. The pulsing sensation might be due to colic, or the movement of the stone through the urinary tract. It's definitely worth seeing a healthcare professional soon to get a proper diagnosis and treatment. In the meantime, staying hydrated and managing pain management is important.",
